                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba naakaswiilila impuwo ya-Solomoni, wakeza ku-Jerusalemu kuti asunke Solomoni atulabi. Wakeza ampu­ mba impati loko, ankamele ziyumwide misamu mibotu, angolida zinji, amabwe mayandisi. Lino naakasika kuli-Solomoni wakaambaula awe makani oonse aakali mumoyo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Solomoni wakamwaambila makani aakwe oonse. Katakwe cintu niciba comwe icakamukacila Solomoni, ncaakakacilwa kumupandulwida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba, naakabona busongo bwa-Solomoni, aŋanda njaakayakide, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "azilyo zyakuntafule yakwe, abalanda bakwe mbubakakede, abasimilimo bakwe mbubakabeleka, azyakusama zyabo, abasikukutauka bakwe, azyakusama zyabo, azipaizyo zyakwe nzyaakatuula kuŋanda ya-Jehova, moyo wakwe wakaata loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaambila mwami kuti, Impuwo njindakaswiilila kucisi cangu yakali yalusinizyo, nkukuti makani aako amakani aabusongo bwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo teendakazuminina majwi aabo mane ndakasika akubona ameso aangu ndemwini. Ncobeni teendakalwiidwa niciba cisela cabusongo bwako bupati. Ulainda impuwo njindakaswiilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali acoolwe bantu bako! Bali acoolwe balanda bako baimvwi kubusyu bwako lyoonse akuswiilila busongo bwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.72.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 72:18",
                  "type": "text"
