              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami Solomoni wakapa mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba kufumbwa moyo wakwe ncowakayanda, ncaakakumbila, atala azintu zyeelene azeezyo nzyaakaletela mwami. Elyo wakapiluka kulimbabo, walo abalanda bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
