        },
        {
          "text": "kutaamba eyo iyakazwa kubasambazi akulibasikuulisya beendeenda, Abalo bami boonse ba-Arabu abeendelezi banyika bakaletela Solomoni ingolida ansiliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami Solomoni wakapanga intobo zyangolida zifulidwe zili myanda yobile. Intobo imwi aimwi yakali amasyekeli aangolida iifulidwe aali myanda iili musanu aumwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakapanga zikwabilizyo zili myanda yotatwe zyangolida iifulidwe, Cikwabilizyo cimwi acimwi cakali masyekeli aangolida aali myanda yotatwe, Nkabela mwami wakazibika muŋanda yamucisaka ca-Lebano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mwami wakapanga cuuno cipati cameja aanzovu akuciziluluzya ingolida iisalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eco cuuno cakalijisi matantilo aali musanu alimwi, acilyokezezyo camaulu cangolida, izyakajatana acuuno, alimwi kubbazu limwi alimwi lyacikalilo kacijisi zilyokezezyo zyamaboko, abalavu bobile baimvwi kumbali lyazilyokezezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kakuli balavu bali ikumi ababili baimvwi amatantilo aali musanu alimwi kulubazu lumwi alumwi, Teekwakacitwa cimwi ceelene ancico abuniini muzisi zyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
