        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela zinywido zyoonse zyamwami Solomoni zyakali zyangolida, azibelesyo zyoonse zyamuŋanda yamucisaka caku-Lebano zyakali zyangolida iisalala. Insiliva teeyakayeeyegwa mbuli cintu mumazuba aa-Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
