        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Solomoni kajisi maanda aali zyuulu zyone aakubika mabbiza ankalaki, abasimbizi bali zyuulu zili ikumi azibili mbaakabika muminzi yankalaki amu-Jerusalemu mwaakabede mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
